{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2b9b0e2b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# TimesFM 2.5-200M Forecasting Notebook\n",
    "Compatible with the latest TimesFM 2.5 PyTorch API.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features**\n",
    "- CSV/Excel input\n",
    "- Custom start/end dates\n",
    "- Forecast for N months\n",
    "- Uses all selected data for training\n",
    "- Displays forecast table and plot\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d041f89a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Install once if needed\n",
    "# !pip install -U timesfm pandas numpy matplotlib openpyxl torch scikit-learn\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cf9dc771",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "import timesfm\n",
    "\n",
    "torch.set_float32_matmul_precision(\"high\")\n",
    "device = \"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\"\n",
    "print(\"Device:\", device)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c47b37dd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "model = timesfm.TimesFM_2p5_200M_torch.from_pretrained(\n",
    "    \"google/timesfm-2.5-200m-pytorch\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "model.compile(\n",
    "    timesfm.ForecastConfig(\n",
    "        max_context=1024,\n",
    "        max_horizon=60,\n",
    "        normalize_inputs=True,\n",
    "        use_continuous_quantile_head=True,\n",
    "        force_flip_invariance=True,\n",
    "        infer_is_positive=True,\n",
    "        fix_quantile_crossing=True,\n",
    "    )\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"Model loaded.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "acbcc969",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "file_path = input(\"Enter CSV/Excel path: \")\n",
    "\n",
    "if file_path.lower().endswith(\".csv\"):\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(file_path)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    df = pd.read_excel(file_path)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(df.head())\n",
    "print(df.columns)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2437d786",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "date_col = input(\"Date column name: \")\n",
    "value_col = input(\"Volume column name: \")\n",
    "\n",
    "df = df[[date_col, value_col]].copy()\n",
    "df.columns = [\"Date\",\"Volume\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"Date\"] = pd.to_datetime(df[\"Date\"])\n",
    "df = df.sort_values(\"Date\")\n",
    "\n",
    "start_date = input(\"Training Start Date (YYYY-MM-DD): \")\n",
    "end_date = input(\"Training End Date (YYYY-MM-DD): \")\n",
    "\n",
    "forecast_months = int(input(\"Forecast Months: \"))\n",
    "\n",
    "df = df[(df[\"Date\"]>=start_date) & (df[\"Date\"]<=end_date)].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(df.head())\n",
    "print(df.tail())\n",
    "print(\"Rows:\", len(df))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "db84e3db",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "history = df[\"Volume\"].astype(float).to_numpy()\n",
    "\n",
    "point_forecast, quantile_forecast = model.forecast(\n",
    "    horizon=forecast_months,\n",
    "    inputs=[history]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "forecast = point_forecast[0]\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5b6261d3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "last_date = df[\"Date\"].max()\n",
    "\n",
    "future_dates = pd.date_range(\n",
    "    last_date + pd.offsets.MonthBegin(1),\n",
    "    periods=forecast_months,\n",
    "    freq=\"MS\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "forecast_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    \"Forecast Date\": future_dates,\n",
    "    \"Forecast Volume\": np.round(forecast).astype(int)\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "forecast_df\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "98f4c2d2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(14,6))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.plot(df[\"Date\"], df[\"Volume\"], label=\"Historical\", linewidth=2)\n",
    "plt.plot(\n",
    "    forecast_df[\"Forecast Date\"],\n",
    "    forecast_df[\"Forecast Volume\"],\n",
    "    marker=\"o\",\n",
    "    linewidth=2,\n",
    "    label=\"Forecast\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.grid(True)\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.title(\"TimesFM Forecast\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3cc3196c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## About Accuracy Metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "Since this notebook trains on **100%** of the selected data and forecasts only future periods,\n",
    "there are no future actual values available. Therefore **MAPE**, **RMSE**, and **MAE** cannot be\n",
    "computed in this workflow.\n",
    "\n",
    "To calculate those metrics, reserve a validation period or perform backtesting.\n"
   ]
  }
 ],
